<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 1-year bond auction for Friday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 1-year bond auction for Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's central bank said the treasury would auction on Friday a one-year bond, longest maturity more than a year.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : October 30, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: October 25, 1996</p>
<p>Value date  : October 30, 1996 --Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
